   "answer": "You can offer discounted service prices to customers who pay with a plan by connecting the service to a Pricing Plan or by creating discount coupons for your Pricing Plans. Steps: 1) Create or edit a Pricing Plan (package or membership) and set the discounted price or benefits you want for plan holders, then save it [2][6]. 2) Connect the booking service to that plan: in the service\u2019s Price & Payment section choose \u201cWith a plan\u201d then Connect Pricing Plans (or create a new plan) and enable the relevant plan(s) [2][7][10]. 3) Alternatively (or additionally), create a discount coupon that applies to a specific pricing plan or to all plans and configure whether it applies to the first billing cycle, all billing cycles, or a custom recurring period; then share the coupon with clients who purchase the plan [5]. References: connecting services to plans and plan workflow [2][6][7][10]; creating coupons for Pricing Plans [5].",
