   "reasoning": "Customer wants step\u2011by\u2011step guidance to reset the password for a second Google Workspace (Gmail) business account; they say they have an admin account. The excerpts include Wix-side instructions for resetting a Google Workspace admin password from the Business Email area [3], and Google Admin console instructions for resetting a user's password directly in Google Workspace [6]. No fact only the customer holds is required to give those procedures (we do not need the specific user email). The customer is asking how to do this (documentation), not asking us to perform the reset, so no human authority is required. We can fully answer with the procedures shown in the excerpts. Supporting excerpts: [3] (Wix Business Email reset) and [6] (Google Admin console reset and password options).",
   "answer": "You can reset that business Gmail account\u2019s password either from Wix (if the mailbox is managed through Wix) or directly in the Google Admin console. Steps: 1) From your Wix account (Business Email): Go to Business Email in your Wix account. Click the More Actions icon next to the admin email and choose Reset admin password. Enter and confirm the new password and click Reset Password. If you still can\u2019t access the inbox after that, use the Google Workspace Login Troubleshooter linked from the Wix article [3]. 2) From the Google Admin console (if you manage users there): Sign in to your Google Admin account, go to Password > Reset Password for the user. You can auto\u2011generate a password or enter one yourself, optionally require the user to change it at next sign\u2011in, then click Reset. Note the default minimum password length is 8 characters and you can change password requirements in the Admin console [6]. If either method doesn\u2019t work, try the Wix troubleshooting link in [3] or follow the additional Google Workspace troubleshooting steps in [6].",
   "v4_decision": "RESOLVE",
   "reference_answer": "To reset the password for your second Gmail account for business, you can follow these steps using your Google Workspace Admin account:\n\n1. Sign in to your [Google Admin account](https://admin.google.com/).\n2. Click on **Users** to view all users in your organization.\n3. Hover over the user account for which you want to reset the password and click the **Reset password** icon.\n4. You can choose to automatically generate a new password or manually enter a new password.\n5. Click **Reset** to apply the changes.\n6. Optionally, you can copy the new password to share it with the user or email it directly to them.\n\nFor more detailed instructions, you can refer to the [Google Workspace: Resetting a Workspace User's Password](https://support.wix.com/en/article/google-workspace-troubleshooting-login-issues#resetting-a-users-password) guide. If you encounter any issues, ensure you are logged in with your admin account and have the necessary permissions to reset user passwords.",
