   "answer": "Here\u2019s how to manage Booking service categories on your Wix site:\n\n1) Create a new category\n- In your site's dashboard go to Booking Services \u2192 Manage Categories \u2192 + Add New Category. Enter the name and click Add to save [2].\n\n2) Assign a service to a category\n- In Booking Services, select the service you want to assign, open the Service category drop-down and choose the relevant category, then click Save. Note: a service can be assigned to only one category at a time [2].\n\n3) Reorder services and categories\n- To reorder services within a category: in Booking Services select the desired category from the drop-down, then click and hold the drag handle next to services to drag them into the order you want [2].\n- To reorder categories: click Manage Categories at the top of the list, then click and hold the drag handle next to categories to drag them into your preferred order. You can hover over a category to rename or delete it, or click + Add New Category to create more [2].\n\n4) Control which categories/services appear on a page (Service List element)\n- In the Editor, add or select the Service List element, click Settings \u2192 Services, then under \u201cHow do you want to choose which services to display?\u201d select Choose by service category (or Choose services directly / Choose by service location) and check the categories/services you want shown on that page [4][8].\n\n5) Additional notes\n- To hide a service from your site entirely, go to the Booking Services tab in your dashboard, select the relevant service and disable the Visible on your site toggle under Display Settings [1].\n- If you want services grouped and easier for clients to find, use categories and the Service List display options described above [8].\n\nIf you tell me which part you\u2019d like to do first (create a category, assign services, reorder, or change what appears on a specific page), I can give step-by-step clicks for the Editor or Dashboard view you\u2019re in.",
