   "answer": "For an individual Wix Payments account you must complete setup and submit the verification documents listed in the Wix Payments verification flow: - Complete your Wix Payments account setup within the same country as your bank (the country of your bank must match the country where you complete setup) [3]. - You\u2019ll be asked to upload a government\u2011issued photo ID (passport, driver\u2019s license or ID card) that is valid, in color, shows all borders/corners, is not blurry, and matches the name and birth date in your account [5]. - You\u2019ll also need to upload a bank document (bank statement, voided check or official bank letter) to verify your bank details, and an address verification document (for example a utility bill) dated within the last six months that clearly shows your name and address [5]. - After you submit these details you go through the verification process; Wix reviews the info and this can take up to 7 business days. If you\u2019ve already accepted your first payment, the verification process begins then and you have 30 days to complete setup before suspension risk [2][3][10]. If you\u2019d like, check your account status in your site dashboard under Accept Payments and click Complete Account Setup to see which specific items are still required [2].",
