   "answer": "You can add delivery information to a product page by adding an Info Section to the product: Go to Products in your site's dashboard, create a new product or edit an existing one, then click + Add an Info Section. Enter a title (e.g. \u201cShipping & Delivery\u201d) and type the delivery information, then click Save. You can also add a table (good for size/charts) using the Table icon, add links to a separate shipping or policy page, and apply the same info section to multiple products at once by selecting multiple products before adding the section. [6]",
