   "answer": "You can preview and place test orders using the Preview Checkout process for Wix Stores. Steps (from the KB):\n\n1) Prepare your site for testing: enable a manual payment method so you won't be charged; alternatively, temporarily unassign the Premium/Studio plan or duplicate your site and test on the duplicate [2].\n2) If your site doesn't have a Members Area, add one. Only the site owner (not Admins or other roles) can preview the checkout [2].\n3) Log in to your Wix account, open your live site, and log in to the site using the Members Area [2].\n4) Navigate to a Shop page, add a product to your cart and click Checkout. When prompted, click I just want to place a test order and complete the checkout flow [2].\n\nNotes and limits from the KB: you can preview checkout only with Wix Stores or Wix Restaurants Orders (New) [2]; you cannot preview product subscription checkouts [2]; if you preview using a non-manual payment method you will be charged (you'll pay and receive payment and any transaction fees still apply) [2].\n\nIf you want, I can also include the checklist for what to verify after placing the test order (order appears in your Orders list, notifications, tracking, etc.) and point to how to manage orders in the Wix app [2].",
