   "answer": "Question: How do I transfer my domain from Wix to another host? To transfer a domain away from Wix: 1) In your Wix account go to Domains. Click the Domain Actions (or Show More / More Actions) icon next to the domain you want to move and select Transfer away from Wix [2][6]. 2) Click Transfer Domain, review the info, then click I Still Want to Transfer to confirm [2]. 3) Wix will send a transfer authorization (EPP) code to the domain's registrant contact email address; use that code with your new domain host and follow their instructions to complete the transfer [2][6]. 4) Transfer timing and rules: transfers can take up to 7 days to complete, and ICANN rules prevent transfers within 60 days of purchase or certain contact changes; transferring also locks the domain from transferring again for 60 days [2]. 5) After you initiate the transfer, Wix cannot track its status \u2014 contact the receiving host for updates; you can also check whois to see a \u201cpending transfer\u201d status once the new host initiates the process [2][10]. 6) Note: after the transfer you\u2019ll need to re-add MX records if you use Wix Business Email, since email settings do not transfer automatically [10].",
