   "answer": "Here are the ways you can view invoices depending on where they come from:\n\n- Invoices you created in your site (Wix Invoices): Go to Invoices in your site\u2019s dashboard to see a list of invoices and manage them [1].\n\n- In Wix Studio: In your Studio workspace go to Marketplace Overview, click the Invoices tab on the left to view and manage invoices [2].\n\n- Invoices for store orders: Go to Orders in your site\u2019s dashboard, open the relevant order, click More Actions and select View Invoice (you can also print, resend by email, or share the invoice link from there) [5].\n\n- Invoices for Wix subscriptions (billing invoices): Go to Billing History in your Wix account, click the More Actions icon next to the subscription and choose View Invoice, then download or print if needed [7].\n\n- Hopp by Wix Pro plan invoices: Log in at hopp.co, go to Settings \u2192 Manage Plan \u2192 View invoices to see your Hopp invoices [10].\n\nIf you tell me which type of invoice you\u2019re trying to view (site invoice, Studio invoice, store order invoice, Wix subscription invoice, or Hopp invoice), I can give step-by-step screenshots or the exact navigation for that case.",
