   "answer": "Question: Why hasn't my Wix payout sent 4 days ago appeared in my Chase bank account? Answer: In many cases a payout sent from Wix can take a few more business days to appear in your bank, and there are a few documented things to check: 1) Timing: After a payout is sent it can take around 3\u20135 business days to reach your bank account, and the first payout can take longer while verification completes [3][1][9]. Since you\u2019re at day 4, it may still be in transit. 2) Processing & grouping: Payments go through processing and scheduling before being sent; if you have multiple payment methods they can be grouped and show multiple payouts on the same date [1][2]. 3) Check the Payouts dashboard: Open Payouts in your site\u2019s dashboard and click the specific payout to see its status and any notes about the transfer [9][4]. The payout detail will show if there was a failure or hold and often includes instructions. 4) Payouts on hold / failures: Payouts are placed on hold for issues such as failed payouts or unresolved verification; once the issue is resolved the funds are added to the next scheduled payout [4]. 5) Bank details and EFT/ACH: A common cause of failed transfers is incorrect bank details or the bank not accepting EFT payments (in the US, payouts are sent as ACH). Verify the bank account name and details in your Wix Payments settings and with your bank to ensure the account can receive EFT/ACH transfers [8]. Steps to take now (in order): - Wait up to the full 3\u20135 business days window if you haven\u2019t reached the end of it yet, accounting for weekends and bank holidays [3][1]. - In your Wix dashboard go to Payouts and click the payout to view details and any error/hold reason shown there [9][4]. - If the payout shows a failure or on-hold reason, follow the dashboard instruction; common fixes are correcting bank details or completing verification [8][4]. - Confirm whether your Wix Payments account has any reserve amounts that might delay availability of some funds (view the In reserve/Released tabs in Payouts) [10]. - Contact your bank (Chase) to ask whether an incoming EFT/ACH from Wix is pending or if they have any holds on it; if the bank confirms no incoming transfer after 5 business days, let us know the payout ID and date and we can escalate. If after these checks you still see no resolution, reply with the payout date and the payout ID (or a screenshot of the payout detail) so we can help further.",
