   "reasoning": "The customer wants to know where their payments processed with Wix Payments are going and how to see them. The excerpts state that Wix Payments processes funds and sends payouts to your bank account, how to view payouts and payment details in the dashboard or Wix Payments account, the typical timing (3\u20135 business days) and that the Wix Payments account must be verified and have an active status; they also show how to view payments on mobile. No fact only the customer holds is required to answer this general question, and the customer is not asking us to perform any privileged action on their account. A human is not required. I can fully answer from the provided excerpts.",
   "answer": "Your Wix Payments funds are sent as payouts from Wix Payments to your bank account; Wix Payments is the provider that processes funds and sends them to your bank. [1][9] You can view payout records and details in your site's dashboard under Payouts (or in the Wix Payments account dashboard) \u2014 click a payout to see more details. [8][3] Payouts are sent on the schedule you choose (daily/weekly/monthly) and, once sent, usually arrive in your bank within about 3\u20135 business days (timing can be affected by currency, bank holidays, and your bank). [1][8][9] Note: to receive payouts your Wix Payments account must be verified and Active, and payouts are only made when there is at least a $1 available balance. [9] If you prefer to view payments on mobile, open the Wix mobile app > Dashboard for the site > Payments to see payment history and tap a transaction for details. [5]",
   "v4_decision": "RESOLVE",
   "reference_answer": "Your first payout can only be scheduled once your Wix Payments account is [successfully verified] (https://support.wix.com/en/article/wix-payments-verification-process). After receiving your first payment, it's available for payout within an average of 7 days. Once the payout is sent, it takes an average of 3-5 business days for the payout to reach your bank account. [Learn more about receiving your payouts] (https://support.wix.com/en/article/receiving-your-payouts-from-wix-payments). \n\nIf you want to verify the bank details associated with your Wix Payments account:\n1. Go to [Accept Payments] (https://www.wix.com/my-account/site-selector/?buttonText=Set%20Up%20Payments&title=Select%20a%20Site&autoSelectOnSingleSite=true&actionUrl=https:%2F%2Fwww.wix.com%2Fdashboard%2F%7B%7BmetaSiteId%7D%7D%2Fpayments%2F) in your site's dashboard. \n2. Click Manage next to Wix Payments. \n3. Click Edit Account Details next to Account Details. \n4. Check the information listed under Bank Details. If necessary, correct it and click Save.",
